WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — satiation (15s) Narrator Gabriel

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.055
First, every job has a finish line, and extra computer work after that point is waste.

2
00:00:06.415 --> 00:00:13.142
Second, cheaper computer work makes people start many more jobs, so total use can keep rising.

3
00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:20.172
Third, money prices for AI are falling fast, but the electricity it burns is never free.
